blurb = "The text describes the salt-production process in Akō. It explains how seawater is drawn and spread over the sand on clear days. Once the water evaporates, the concentrated salty sand is gathered. Brine is extracted from this sand and boiled down in flat kettles to produce high-quality salt \"as white as snow\"."
